   Zhao, Yan, Hong Kong Polytech Univ, Sch Nursing, WHO Collaborating Ctr Community Hlth Serv, Hong Kong 999077, Peoples R China.
   Chiu, Ching-Ju, Natl Cheng Kung Univ, Inst Gerontol, Coll Med, Tainan 70101, Taiwan.},
